{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_HAIKU__"}}----

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_HAIKU__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time when the Haiku target is
	being used.  It can be used to compile parts of a program only for Haiku.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#IFDEF __FB_HAIKU__
	print "Haiku target"
#ENDIF
%%

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Predefined Defines"}}
{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	[[CompilerOpttarget|Compiler Option: -target]]
----
